  <p>
    A ringtone from the chorus, the silence at the start of a recording, a sample from a long session: often all you need is one clean cut. The KodiniTools Audio Cutter does it in the browser, accurate to the millisecond. You see the waveform, set start and end, preview the selection and export the result. No installation, no registration, no upload.
  </p>

